{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CuRjdRqa2m1795163655.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞太區股市跟隨外圍下跌。</p><p></p><p>日本股市低開逾百分之1後，跌幅持續擴大，並以全日最低位收市，收市跌逾3,000點。韓國股市在晶片股拖累，跌幅曾擴大至近百分之6，收市跌穿5,000點關口。台灣股市收市跌逾2,300點。澳洲股市在金融及礦業股拖累，收市跌逾百分之1。</p><p></p><p>全個星期計，四大指數均錄得跌幅，以台灣股市跌幅最大，全周跌逾一成七，創1991年以來最大單周跌幅。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:43:56.254826+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T20:57:33.088533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:13.797010+00:00","content_hash":"6844f51d3acce02d1ecc260f25d6c2a13916058d7fefbbbf29cc2d0bbb1f6583","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:43:56.254826+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}